#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:5
msgid "How It Works - CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Zvinoshanda sei - CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:172
msgid ""
"From spotting symptoms to getting recommendations and connecting with vets—"
"here's your step-by-step guide to CattleCare AI."
msgstr ""
"Kubva pakuona zviratidzo kusvika kuwana mazano uye kubatana neveti—ino nzira "
"yako yenhanho nhanho kuCattleCare AI."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:179
msgid "Simple, Clear Process"
msgstr "Nzira Nyore, Yakajeka"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:180
msgid ""
"You don't need technical skills. Register once, then submit cases whenever "
"you notice something wrong with your cattle. Our AI and vet network do the "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"Haunei kuziva zvokuita. Nyoresa kamwe, wobva uisa nyaya pese pawanoona "
"chinhu chakaipa nemombe dzako. AI yedu nevatariri vemhuka vanoita zvimwe."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:185
msgid "Register once"
msgstr "Nyoresa kamwe chete"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:186
msgid ""
"Create your farmer account with your contact details and location. It's free "
"and only takes a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Gadzira account yako yemurimi neruzivo rwekubata nhevedzo uye nzvimbo. "
"Haibhadharwi uye inotorawo maminitsi mashoma."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:192
msgid "Submit when needed"
msgstr "Tumira kana zvichidikanwa"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:193
msgid ""
"Whenever you see symptoms, log in and fill in our guided form. No need to "
"wait for office hours."
msgstr ""
"Kana waona zviratidzo, pinda uye uzadze fomo redu rinoratidza nzira. Hakuda "
"kumirira nguva dzemahofisi."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:199
msgid "AI + vets"
msgstr "AI + veti"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:200
msgid ""
"Get an instant prediction and recommendations. For serious cases, choose a "
"vet from your region."
msgstr ""
"Wana chitarisiro uye mazano nokukurumidza. Kune nyaya dzakakomba, sarudza "
"veti kubva mundunhu yako."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:206
msgid "Track history"
msgstr "Tevedzera nhoroondo"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:207
msgid ""
"All your cases are saved. Review past predictions and treatments anytime "
"from your dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Nyaya dzako dzose dzakachengetwa. Ona zvitarisiro zvekare uye kurapa nguva "
"dzose kubva kadhashibhodi yako."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:217
msgid "The Four Steps in Detail"
msgstr "Matanho Mana Nenzira Yakazara"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:218
msgid "What happens after you submit a case."
msgstr "Chinoitika mushure mekuisa nyaya."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:224
msgid ""
"Describe what you see: behaviour changes, appetite, skin, eyes, breathing, "
"etc. You can add age, breed, and herd size. The more accurate the "
"information, the better the prediction."
msgstr ""
"Rondedzera zvawaona: shanduko dzamaitiro, mwero wekudya, ganda, maziso, "
"kupfuura mweya, nezvimwe. Unogona kuwedzera makore, rudzi, uye huwandu "
"hwemhomho. Ruzivo rwakakwana runopa chitarisiro chakanakanisa."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:231
msgid ""
"Our machine learning models (trained on cattle disease data) analyze the "
"symptoms and return the most likely disease with a confidence score. This "
"usually takes only a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Mamodeli edu ekudzidza kwemuchina (adzidziswa pamwe neruzivo rwezvirwere "
"zvemombe) anoongorora zviratidzo uye anodzorera chirwere chakanyanya kuita "
"seche chikwereti chekuvimba. Izvi zvinowanzotora masekondi mashoma chete."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:238
msgid ""
"You receive treatment suggestions, quarantine steps, and preventive measures "
"tailored to the predicted condition. Follow them while considering your "
"vet's advice for serious cases."
msgstr ""
"Unogashira mazano ekurapa, nhanho dzekuchengetwa, uye nzira dzekudzivirira "
"dzakagadziridzirwa mamiriro akatarisirwa. Atevere uchifunga mazano aveti "
"wako kune nyaya dzakakomba."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:245
msgid ""
"For severe or critical cases, the platform lets you choose a Ministry-"
"approved vet in your province. You can request a consultation so the vet can "
"advise or visit when needed."
msgstr ""
"Kune nyaya dzakakomba kana dzakakomba kwazvo, ndima inokubvumidza kusarudza "
"veti akabvumidzwa neMinistry mumurovha wako. Unogona kukumbira kubvunzana "
"kuitira kuti veti akupe zano kana kuuya kana zvichidikanwa."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:255
msgid "What You Need to Get Started"
msgstr "Zvaunoda Kutanga"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:256
msgid "A few things that help you get the most out of CattleCare AI."
msgstr ""
"Zvinhu zvishoma zvinokubatsira kuwana zvakawanda kubva kuCattleCare AI."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:261
msgid "Device and internet"
msgstr "Mudziyo neinternet"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:262
msgid ""
"Use a smartphone, tablet, or computer with internet access. The platform "
"works in the browser—no app install required."
msgstr ""
"Shandisa foni yekuchenjera, tablet, kana kompyuta ine internet. Nzvimbo "
"inoshanda mubrowser—hapana app inofanirwa kuiswa."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:268
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "Kutarisa"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:269
msgid ""
"Note what you see in your cattle: symptoms, duration, and how many animals "
"are affected. Clear descriptions improve prediction accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Nyora zvawaona mumombe yako: zviratidzo, nguva, uye mhuka ngapi dzakabatwa. "
"Rondedzero yakajeka inowedzera kururama kwekutarisa."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:276
msgid ""
"Your province and district help us match you with nearby vets and contribute "
"to national disease surveillance."
msgstr ""
"Purovhinzi yako nedunhu rinokubatsira isu kukubatanidza nevatariri vemhuka "
"vepedyo uye kuita basa rekutarira zvirwere panyika."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:286
msgid "Tips for Best Results"
msgstr "Mazano ekuwana Mhedzisiro Yakanaka"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:287
msgid ""
"Follow these practices to get the most accurate predictions and useful "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Tevedza nzira idzi kuwana zvitarisiro zvakanyanya kururama uye mazano "
"anobatsira."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:292
msgid "Be as specific as you can"
msgstr "Iva nenharembozha sezvaungakwanisa"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:293
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Mention all relevant symptoms (e.g. fever, cough, lameness, loss of "
#| "appetite). Include how long they've been present and whether multiple "
#| "animals are affected. This helps the AI narrow down the likely disease."
msgid ""
"Mention all relevant symptoms (e.g. fever, cough, lameness, loss of "
"appetite). Include how long they’ve been present and whether multiple "
"animals are affected. This helps the AI narrow down the likely disease."
msgstr ""
"Taura zviratidzo zvose zvakakosha (semuenzaniso. febhe, chikosoro, kurema "
"kwemakumbo, kusada kudya). Sanganisira nguva yazvange zviripo uye kana mhuka "
"dzakawanda dzakatorwa. Izvi zvibatsira AI kuderedza chirwere chinonetsa."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:299
msgid "When to involve a vet"
msgstr "Rinhi rokuisa veti"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:300
msgid ""
"For critical or severe cases, or when the recommendation suggests "
"professional care, use the vet connection feature. Don't rely on prediction "
"alone for life-threatening or unclear situations."
msgstr ""
"Kune nyaya dzinokosha kana dzakakomba, kana kana mazano achiti fambira kune "
"rukova rweprofession, shandisa chimiro chekubatana neveti. Usavimba "
"nekutarisa chete kune mamiriro anotyisa kana asina kujeka."

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:310
msgid "Ready to start?"
msgstr "Wakagadzirira kutanga?"

#: .\templates\landing\how_it_works.html:311
msgid "Register as a farmer and submit your first case in minutes."
msgstr "Nyoresa semurimi uye tumira nyaya yako yekutanga mumaminitsi."

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:5
msgid "Privacy Policy - CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Mutemo weKuchengetedzwa kweRuzivo - CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:66
msgid "How CattleCare AI collects, uses, and protects your information."
msgstr ""
"Nzira iyo CattleCare AI inoungana, kushandisa, uye kuchengetedza ruzivo "
"rwako nayo."

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:72
#: .\templates\landing\terms_of_service.html:74
msgid "Last updated:"
msgstr "Yakachinjiwa panaguru:"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:74
msgid "1. Introduction"
msgstr "1. Nhanganyaya"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:75
msgid ""
"CattleCare AI (“we”, “our”, or “the platform”) is an early disease "
"prediction and veterinary support system for cattle, operated in support of "
"the Ministry of Agriculture, Zimbabwe. This Privacy Policy explains how we "
"collect, use, store, and protect your personal and farm-related information "
"when you use our website and services."
msgstr ""
"CattleCare AI (“isu”, “yedu”, kana “puratifomu”) inzira yekufungidzira "
"zvirwere nekukurumidza uye rubatsiro rweveti rwemombe, inoshandiswa "
"kutsigira Ministry yeAgriculture yeZimbabwe. Mutemo uyu weKuvanzika "
"unotsanangura kuti tinounganidza sei, tinoshandisa sei, tinochengeta sei, "
"uye tinodzivirira sei ruzivo rwako uye rwepurazi paunoshandisa webhusaiti "
"nemasevhisi edu."

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:76
msgid ""
"By registering as a farmer, applying as a veterinarian, or using the "
"platform in any way, you agree to the practices described in this policy."
msgstr ""
"Nekunyoresa semurimi, kunyorera kuva vet, kana kushandisa puratifomu neimwe "
"nzira, unobvuma maitiro atsanangurwa mumutemo uyu."

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:78
msgid "2. Information We Collect"
msgstr "2. Ruzivo Rwatinoungana"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:79
msgid "Account and profile information"
msgstr "Ruzivo rweaccount neprofile"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:80
msgid "When you register or use the platform, we may collect:"
msgstr "Paunonyoresa kana kushandisa puratifomu, tinogona kuunganidza:"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:82
msgid "Name, email address, phone number, and username"
msgstr "Zita, kero yeemail, nhamba yefoni, uye zita rekushandisa (username)"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:83
msgid "Province, district, and (where provided) location or GPS coordinates"
msgstr "Purovhinzi, dunhu, uye (kana zvapihwa) nzvimbo kana maGPS coordinates"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:84
msgid ""
"For farmers: farm details such as cattle breed, herd size, and farming type"
msgstr ""
"Kune varimi: ruzivo rwepurazi senge rudzi rwemombe, huwandu hweboka, uye "
"mhando yekurima"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:85
msgid ""
"For veterinarians: professional details, qualifications, and provinces served"
msgstr ""
"Kune veti: ruzivo rwebasa, zvinokwanisa (qualifications), uye mapurovhinzi "
"avanoshanda"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:87
msgid "Case and usage information"
msgstr "Ruzivo rwenyaya nekushandiswa"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:88
msgid "When you submit a disease case or use our features, we collect:"
msgstr ""
"Paunotumira nyaya yechirwere kana kushandisa zvinhu zvedu, tinounganidza:"

#: .\templates\landing\privacy_policy.html:90
msgid "Symptoms and other data you enter for disease prediction"
